We go into the kitchen.
The kitchen is small and bright.
Nina opens a cupboard.
"Look," she says.
The cups stand in the cupboard.
They are white and blue.
Nina points to a shelf.
The plates lie on the shelf.
By the window stands a small table.
It is a round table.
Nina looks at me.
"Now we can make coffee here," she says.
She laughs.
That sounds good.
Yes, now we can make coffee.
